Test for consistent usage of halo mass in Msun in the HOD model implementation,
at the level of multiplying HMF and getting same number of satellites and
centrals. 
Compare this with the numbers obtained from the Msun/h unit implementation.

- The hod.py file should remain independent of the cosmological parameters.
- It would be appropriate to separate out cosmology dependent quantities in a different file.
- to account for all the h-factors, adjust h-factors inside hod.py
- This h agnostic file would therefore be general and remain applicable to any
  definition of mass. And you would just have to adjust these choices either in
  HOD parameters or cosmology dependent scripts.

